WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.680
Slop University is an experiment, made as an artwork.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.410
It is a fictional institution: a working university that has never taught anyone anything.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:18.790
Its research outputs, press releases, researcher profiles and identifiers are generated by an autonomous software pipeline,

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.200
that runs on a timer.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.420
A capable language model can satisfy every proxy that research is judged by:

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.270
an output,

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.050
a crest,

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:27.993
a DOI,

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:28.973
a citation,

00:00:29.373 --> 00:00:31.423
without understanding anything it produces.

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:36.413
The machinery that confers academic legitimacy keeps running,

00:00:36.713 --> 00:00:39.083
even when no one understands what goes through it.

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:41.843
Slop University runs that machinery in the open.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:45.123
Nothing here pollutes the scholarly record.

00:00:45.523 --> 00:00:49.703
Its DOIs use the reserved test prefix, ten point five five five five,

00:00:50.003 --> 00:00:52.173
and resolve only through its own site.

00:00:53.173 --> 00:00:54.743
Nothing here impersonates anyone.

00:00:55.143 --> 00:00:57.823
The researchers are invented, and checked against real people;

00:00:58.123 --> 00:00:59.313
every image is generated.

00:01:00.313 --> 00:01:02.793
Exactly one real person appears here:

00:01:03.093 --> 00:01:05.183
the artist, as its Vice-Chancellor.

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:07.859
He decides what the University publishes,

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:10.749
and makes no difference to the output whatsoever.

00:01:11.949 --> 00:01:14.642
This is not a comment on any particular institution.

00:01:15.042 --> 00:01:17.132
It is a comment about systems,

00:01:17.432 --> 00:01:20.062
and about the things those systems incentivise.

00:01:21.662 --> 00:01:23.582
To find out more, visit the website,

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:24.962
follow us on Bluesky,

00:01:25.162 --> 00:01:26.212
or send us an email.
